  message: "Fixed in PR #2276 (195089e80) under the owner ruling of 2026-11-19. Live re-run on dev 3c109b3aa (evidence fast_smart_test_build_11172026/closure_pr2/nidun.txt): claims: [] -> rc 2 'has no claims to check'; 0-byte claims file -> rc 2; claim id: 5 -> rc 2 \"'id' in claim '#1' must be a string, got int: 5\"; max_chains: -1 -> rc 2 'must be 0 or more'; io-boundaries --input missing -> rc 2 'Input file not found'; --input a directory -> rc 2 'could not read behavior map /tmp: Is a directory'; sketch | head -c 10 -> rc 141. Internal error -> 70 and broken pipe -> 141 are set in main() (cli.py EXIT_INTERNAL_ERROR / EXIT_BROKEN_PIPE); record-field types checked by the table at cli.py ~7114; production-path tests test_cli_input_bad_input_exit.py, test_verify_claims_exit_contract.py; 18/18 mutations killed. NOT DONE, filed separately: (1) 'hypergumbo symbols | head' still exits 1, because rich's Console.on_broken_pipe raises SystemExit(1) before main() sees the BrokenPipeError; (2) bad input still exits 1 in sketch/run (path missing or a file), slice --files, slice/explain lookup errors and tool commands. allowed_sanitizers waits for WI-biraf. Items 8 and 9 (overlay/summary field types; which commands load a catalogue) were not probed."  # ea03
